{"offset":0,"limit":2,"endOfRecords":false,"count":124569,"results":[{"key":"484d9314-9014-47c1-82ae-37f762151de0","installationKey":"791e3715-7452-4dd0-a906-db21a3852427","publishingOrganizationKey":"abc73a0f-15d6-48d4-822d-da6be66601da","networkKeys":[],"doi":"10.15468/btjbhc","external":false,"numConstituents":0,"type":"SAMPLING_EVENT","subtype":"OBSERVATION","title":"Inventory of vascular plants in a permanent plot on the Piton de la Fournaise, La Réunion (France)","description":"<para>The dataset comprises a detailed floristic and structural inventory of the ericoid shrubland (fourrés éricoïdes) on the Piton de la Fournaise, Réunion Island (France). Field surveys conducted in November 2020 and April–May 2021 covered a 2,500 m² plot divided into 25 subplots. For each recorded plant individual, the scientific name, height, life stage (juvenile/adult), and X–Y position within the subplot was noted. In total, 16145 individuals representing 18 species and eight families were recorded, including endemic, native and exotic species. The dataset provides occurrence and abundance information suitable for analysing species composition, vegetation structure, regeneration and spatial distribution in this high-elevation ecosystem.</para>","language":"eng","homepage":"https://www.biomoni-islandplots.eu/datasets-advanced-search/","citation":{"text":"PVBMT Research Unit, University of Reunion, CIRAD. Inventory of vascular plants in a permanent plot on the Piton de la Fournaise, La Réunion (France). Sampling event dataset https://doi.org/10.15468/btjbhc accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-10-05.","citationProvidedBySource":false},"contactsCitation":[],"lockedForAutoUpdate":false,"createdBy":"abc73a0f-15d6-48d4-822d-da6be66601da","modifiedBy":"abc73a0f-15d6-48d4-822d-da6be66601da","created":"2026-10-05T07:32:05.985+00:00","modified":"2026-10-05T07:32:05.985+00:00","contacts":[{"key":7636243,"type":"ADMINISTRATIVE_POINT_OF_CONTACT","primary":true,"userId":[],"firstName":"Claudine  Ah-Pe