ías.</p><para/>","language":"spa","logoUrl":"https://gitlab.com/sib-colombia/logos/-/raw/main/socio-SiB-uptc.png","citation":{"text":"Gasca Álvarez H J, Bueno G, Espitía D, Arroyo J, Pulido M J, Quiroga D, Mateus C, Galindo L, Villate L, Martín C (2026). Escarabajos de la Reserva Asociación Magia Fura y Tena (Pauna: Boyacá). Universidad Pedagógica y Tecnológica de Colombia. Occurrence dataset https://doi.org/10.15472/hbv6ih accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-10-05.","identifier":"https://doi.org/10.15472/hbv6ih","citationProvidedBySource":false},"contactsCitation":[{"key":7634823,"abbreviatedName":"Gasca Álvarez H J","firstName":"Héctor Jaime","lastName":"Gasca Álvarez","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634824,"abbreviatedName":"Bueno G","firstName":"Gabriela","lastName":"Bueno","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634825,"abbreviatedName":"Espitía D","firstName":"Diana","lastName":"Espitía","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634826,"abbreviatedName":"Arroyo J","firstName":"Juan","lastName":"Arroyo","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634827,"abbreviatedName":"Pulido M J","firstName":"María José","lastName":"Pulido","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634828,"abbreviatedName":"Quiroga D","firstName":"David","lastName":"Quiroga","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634829,"abbreviatedName":"Mateus C","firstName":"Carlos","lastName":"Mateus","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634830,"abbreviatedName":"Galindo L","firstName":"Laura","lastName":"Galindo","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634831,"abbreviatedName":"Villate L","firstName":"Leidy","lastName":"Villate","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]},{"key":7634832,"abbreviatedName":"Martín C","firstName":"Camilo","lastName":"Martín","roles":["METADATA_AUTHOR","ORIGINATOR"],"userId":[]}],"lockedForAu